From 11365fcb66c9faf2710cbf2b65c6fd903e460049 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:43:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpl-gpu-rt: Fix stale av1ehw_xe2_cdef.cpp reference after
 real build test

Discovered via an actual flashfiles build attempt (not reachable in
this session's sandbox, which lacks a working nsjail/build
environment): ninja failed needing
vendor/intel/external/onevpl-intel-gpu/_studio/mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/Xe2/av1ehw_xe2_cdef.cpp,
"missing and no known rule to make it".

This exposed a gap in the earlier glue-reconciliation pass: AV1 and
HEVC HW encode were already extensively wired into this Android.mk
via large explicit MFX_LOCAL_SRC_FILES_HW file lists (139 explicit
.cpp/.c references total) well before this version bump -- contrary
to what an earlier commit in this series claimed, this was not left
unwired out of scope. The intel-onevpl-26.2.3 overlay renamed
agnostic/Xe2/av1ehw_xe2_cdef.cpp to agnostic/base/av1ehw_base_cdef.cpp
(confirmed a 98%-similar content rename), and this one explicit
reference was not updated to match.

A scripted audit of all 139 explicit file references in this
Android.mk, plus the srcs lists in gmmlib/libva's Android.bp and a
regenerated-content check of media-driver's Android.bp, found this to
be the only stale reference introduced by the whole upgrade effort.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 _studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk b/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
index de706a40..9f2eaf5e 100644
--- a/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
+++ b/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
@@ -69,7 +69,7 @@ MFX_LOCAL_SRC_FILES_HW += \
     mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/base/av1ehw_base_enctools.cpp \
     mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/base/av1ehw_base_hdr.cpp \
     mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/base/av1ehw_base_scc.cpp \
-    mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/Xe2/av1ehw_xe2_cdef.cpp \
+    mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/base/av1ehw_base_cdef.cpp \
     mfx_lib/encode_hw/av1/agnostic/Xe2/av1ehw_xe2_scc.cpp \
 
 MFX_LOCAL_SRC_FILES_HW += \
-- 
